            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And of the children of Israel’s half, which Moses divided off from the men that warred ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(now the congregation’s half was three hundred thousand and thirty thousand, seven thousand and five hundred sheep, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and thirty and six thousand oxen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and thirty thousand and five hundred asses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and sixteen thousand persons), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "even of the children of Israel’s half, Moses took one drawn out of every fifty, both of man and of beast, and gave them unto the Levites, that kept the charge of the tabernacle of Jehovah; as Jehovah commanded Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the officers that were over the thousands of the host, the captains of thousands, and the captains of hundreds, came near unto Moses; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and they said unto Moses, Thy servants have taken the sum of the men of war that are under our charge, and there lacketh not one man of us. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And we have brought Jehovah’s oblation, what every man hath gotten, of jewels of gold, ankle-chains, and bracelets, signet-rings, ear-rings, and armlets, to make atonement for our souls before Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses and Eleazar the priest took the gold of them, even all wrought jewels. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And all the gold of the heave-offering that they offered up to Jehovah, of the captains of thousands, and of the captains of hundreds, was sixteen thousand seven hundred and fifty shekels. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the men of war had taken booty, every man for himself.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses and Eleazar the priest took the gold of the captains of thousands and of hundreds, and brought it into the tent of meeting, for a memorial for the children of Israel before Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
